        "title": "Thermosets: Epoxies, Polyurethanes, Phenolics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The defining distinction from thermoplastics: covalent cross-links between\nchains, not just entanglements. Once formed, the 3D network cannot be un-made\nby heat. \"Thermoset\" = set by heat (or catalyst + heat)."
    },
