        "title": "Thermosets: Epoxies, Polyurethanes, Phenolics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   LOW CROSSLINK DENSITY         HIGH CROSSLINK DENSITY\n   ─────────────────────         ──────────────────────\n   ~~~|~~~                       ~|~|~|~\n   ~~~~~                         ~|~|~\n   ~~~|~~~                       ~|~|~|~\n   Flexible rubber               Rigid glassy\n   EPDM, silicone                Epoxy, phenolic\n   Swells in solvent             Barely swells"
    },
